What is Datadog?

Datadog is a cloud-based monitoring, logging, and observability platform used by DevOps & SRE teams to monitor infrastructure, applications, logs, and user experience — all in one place.

It provides real-time visibility into your systems running on:
☁️ Cloud (AWS, Azure, GCP)
🐳 Containers (Docker, Kubernetes)
🖥️ On-prem servers
🧠 Core Concept (In Simple Words)
👉 Datadog collects Metrics + Logs + Traces + Events
👉 Correlates them in one platform
👉 Helps you detect, troubleshoot, and optimize issues faster

