🔍 Step-by-Step Flow
Data Collection (Agent)
Install Datadog Agent on hosts (EC2, VM, Kubernetes nodes)

Collects:
CPU, Memory, Disk (metrics)

Logs
Network data
Data Ingestion
Agent sends data securely to Datadog SaaS platform
Processing & Correlation
Datadog correlates:
Logs ↔ Metrics ↔ Traces
Uses tags (env, service, host)
Visualization
Dashboards (real-time monitoring)
Alerting
Alerts triggered via thresholds or anomalies

